    {
      "sourceRef": "bf17146f",
      "cellIndex": 1,
      "originalCellId": "bf17146f",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "[![DIIT - UNLaM]([embedded image omitted])](https://ingenieria.unlam.edu.ar/)    \n[![by-nc-sa_80x15.png]([embedded image omitted])](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\n2025 [Víctor A. Bettachini](mailto:vbettachini@unlam.edu.ar)\n\n---",
      "sourceSha256": "a099d5d9e30f1b3d866d17b77a7be605f812f1c2ec08c475233991d08aa58e6d",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": []
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "ea199404-8074-4a80-aeb2-15551f9d671c",
      "cellIndex": 2,
      "originalCellId": "ea199404-8074-4a80-aeb2-15551f9d671c",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "When modeling mechanical systems using generalized coordinates or velocities linked by constraints, it's possible that the corresponding Euler-Lagrange equation for each coordinate to be coupled to others.\n\nWe are usually interested in expressions for a particular acceleration that is not in terms of others, when solving the dynamics numerically.\n\nNow we will generate a system of linear equations without actual applications, only to show two alternatives from the [SymPy library](https://www.sympy.org/index.html) that solve it in terms of one of the second derivatives.",
      "sourceSha256": "06bdcbc25dcb4c30b7c5816e05c8afe414019fcdd94836825395f6900687a424",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": []
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "ce67488b",
      "cellIndex": 3,
      "originalCellId": "ce67488b",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## System of coupled linear equations",
      "sourceSha256": "a586591515da5a83f2c9164e7490e3fc632e4e9c1284e11551b05daabac2b9bf",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": []
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "5053e950-d5ff-45c4-bdff-65a9620c7c95",
      "cellIndex": 4,
      "originalCellId": "5053e950-d5ff-45c4-bdff-65a9620c7c95",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "import sympy as sm # import functions for symbolic manipulations\nfrom sympy.physics import mechanics as me\nme.init_vprinting() # dot notation for velocity and acceleration",
      "sourceSha256": "3dae65e10b8e2fe1283667cfbd2cbf89289bc7343e42b12c25bf2101c99dd564",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [
          "sympy",
          "sympy.physics"
        ],
        "calls": [
          "me.init_vprinting"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "52aa449e-2a47-4ba2-8732-214b8731135f",
      "cellIndex": 5,
      "originalCellId": "52aa449e-2a47-4ba2-8732-214b8731135f",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "t = sm.Symbol('t')\nm1, m2, m3, g = sm.symbols('m_1, m_2, m_3, g')\ny1, y2 = me.dynamicsymbols('y_1, y_2')",
      "sourceSha256": "48326b682d38a5031f8a4547be4a7d6ec07b2a4ce2cd94842db77290fdbe8450",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "me.dynamicsymbols",
          "sm.Symbol",
          "sm.symbols"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "2e0b7005-46a1-4db0-9722-5080e89bcc9e",
      "cellIndex": 6,
      "originalCellId": "2e0b7005-46a1-4db0-9722-5080e89bcc9e",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "equation1 = sm.Eq(\n    g* (-m1+ m2+ m3)+ m1* y1.diff(t,2)+ m2* (y1.diff(t,2)- y2.diff(t,2))+ m3* (y1.diff(t,2) + y2.diff(t,2)) ,\n    0 )\nequation1",
      "sourceSha256": "7756cb2dfb51a71f8180a6d31f1e2b3929e6a2f759f287f79feded33ea7145e6",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "g⋅(-m₁ + m₂ + m₃) + m₁⋅y₁̈ + m₂⋅(y₁̈ - y₂̈) + m₃⋅(y₁̈ + y₂̈) = 0",
          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle g \\left(- m_{1} + m_{2} + m_{3}\\right) + m_{1} \\ddot{y}_{1} + m_{2} \\left(\\ddot{y}_{1} - \\ddot{y}_{2}\\right) + m_{3} \\left(\\ddot{y}_{1} + \\ddot{y}_{2}\\right) = 0$"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
        "image/png",
        "text/latex",
        "text/plain"
      ],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "sm.Eq",
          "y1.diff",
          "y2.diff"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "e01d7415-fccf-4d43-a761-3fef9999abd2",
      "cellIndex": 7,
      "originalCellId": "e01d7415-fccf-4d43-a761-3fef9999abd2",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "equation2 = sm.Eq(\n    g* (m2- m3)+ m2* (y1.diff(t,2)- y2.diff(t,2))- m3* (y1.diff(t,2) + y2.diff(t,2)) ,\n    0 )\nequation2",
      "sourceSha256": "03855bb293adf2ba7fd72e6f07d6a27ca2a0916b6dd3861162d162260299787a",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "g⋅(m₂ - m₃) + m₂⋅(y₁̈ - y₂̈) - m₃⋅(y₁̈ + y₂̈) = 0",
          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle g \\left(m_{2} - m_{3}\\right) + m_{2} \\left(\\ddot{y}_{1} - \\ddot{y}_{2}\\right) - m_{3} \\left(\\ddot{y}_{1} + \\ddot{y}_{2}\\right) = 0$"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
        "image/png",
        "text/latex",
        "text/plain"
      ],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "sm.Eq",
          "y1.diff",
          "y2.diff"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "10c2bc36-d260-4a1e-9c1a-c804717ae70c",
      "cellIndex": 8,
      "originalCellId": "10c2bc36-d260-4a1e-9c1a-c804717ae70c",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "systemEquations = [\n    equation1,\n    equation2,\n] # list with both equations",
      "sourceSha256": "7a74ed9a8170ad5cd86d71077227ab6ebb35ebe0cc47b683e02e81f2b4187ba9",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "d8b09a72-329f-40ab-9d3f-57043159eefe",
      "cellIndex": 9,
      "originalCellId": "d8b09a72-329f-40ab-9d3f-57043159eefe",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "variablesSolution = [\n    y1.diff(t,2),\n    y2.diff(t,2),\n] # list with variables to solve (the accelerations)",
      "sourceSha256": "fa96348c1522cd592dd4180a4596ee4b468d1dff1acbc519eb55819497f183fb",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "y1.diff",
          "y2.diff"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "979c6cbd",
      "cellIndex": 10,
      "originalCellId": "979c6cbd",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Solvers",
      "sourceSha256": "86e5b87a9829a52413d7dcb9f66493722f70385773f155b0b4432d0981778efe",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": []
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "36eb7d90",
      "cellIndex": 11,
      "originalCellId": "36eb7d90",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "`SymPy` has several methods for solving systems of equations.\nThe reference has a [complete guide of the available options](https://docs.sympy.org/latest/guides/solving/index.html).\n\nWe are now going to use two of these to solve the system of linear equations previously generated.",
      "sourceSha256": "c63fec2d874c4ced628627dee256f3f8752cf3ddd6ea79569a6aa9b04f819783",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": []
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "927cf06f-9615-4413-900a-e070052911dc",
      "cellIndex": 12,
      "originalCellId": "927cf06f-9615-4413-900a-e070052911dc",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Alternative 1 | linsolve\n",
      "sourceSha256": "af04e87f201701de1aa7166da23c6035465da3d90c03c9de7c59e08351ed4621",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": []
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "2783e2fb",
      "cellIndex": 13,
      "originalCellId": "2783e2fb",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "If the system is linear, the recommendation is to use the function `linsolve`.",
      "sourceSha256": "a2a6ff3e4b767a4c7eb81a8c6bd77de1358dfb249afe9c3025745b295cb5d3d5",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": []
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "83cee49f-8dc7-46e5-b439-90f5b9fce2b3",
      "cellIndex": 14,
      "originalCellId": "83cee49f-8dc7-46e5-b439-90f5b9fce2b3",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "solution_linsolve = sm.linsolve(systemEquations, variablesSolution)\nsolution_linsolve",
      "sourceSha256": "e18b3308d2fdd3b4f4b97e566ea3606bd3e5ff52e12d7a8c9561a3d3b6214d2b",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "⎧⎛g⋅m₁⋅m₂ + g⋅m₁⋅m₃ - 4⋅g⋅m₂⋅m₃   2⋅g⋅m₁⋅m₂ - 2⋅g⋅m₁⋅m₃ ⎞⎫\n⎨⎜─────────────────────────────, ───────────────────────⎟⎬\n⎩⎝   m₁⋅m₂ + m₁⋅m₃ + 4⋅m₂⋅m₃     m₁⋅m₂ + m₁⋅m₃ + 4⋅m₂⋅m₃⎠⎭",
          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle \\left\\{\\left( \\frac{g m_{1} m_{2} + g m_{1} m_{3} - 4 g m_{2} m_{3}}{m_{1} m_{2} + m_{1} m_{3} + 4 m_{2} m_{3}}, \\  \\frac{2 g m_{1} m_{2} - 2 g m_{1} m_{3}}{m_{1} m_{2} + m_{1} m_{3} + 4 m_{2} m_{3}}\\right)\\right\\}$"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
        "image/png",
        "text/latex",
        "text/plain"
      ],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "sm.linsolve"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "e2e7de4c-0ca3-45f9-9441-97da50523de0",
      "cellIndex": 15,
      "originalCellId": "e2e7de4c-0ca3-45f9-9441-97da50523de0",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Function [linsolve](https://docs.sympy.org/latest/modules/solvers/solveset.html?highlight=linsolve#linsolve) returns a finite set (`FinitSet`) as solution since eventually this could be non unique or a set.\nSymPy express this structure between curly brackets.",
      "sourceSha256": "ce2db149ce8425cd496a707e701a1621255b227f17be05e09e2fe1c95181ebbf",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": []
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "0f1afaef-b037-421a-9f12-835601e5574d",
      "cellIndex": 16,
      "originalCellId": "0f1afaef-b037-421a-9f12-835601e5574d",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "type(solution_linsolve)",
      "sourceSha256": "eda6fee0765b94530b86d5e2b8a22ffdacd22f6a7abd63f615ce06c1b3e0234d",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "sympy.sets.sets.FiniteSet"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
        "text/plain"
      ],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "type"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "b62f7f38-5cba-4795-817c-7c3d0c9115cc",
      "cellIndex": 17,
      "originalCellId": "b62f7f38-5cba-4795-817c-7c3d0c9115cc",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "solution_linsolve.args[0]",
      "sourceSha256": "de216c09cd44ddf27524112c8071d4e7dc5c0b19e7d56b766e46b3671cb4887f",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "⎛g⋅m₁⋅m₂ + g⋅m₁⋅m₃ - 4⋅g⋅m₂⋅m₃   2⋅g⋅m₁⋅m₂ - 2⋅g⋅m₁⋅m₃ ⎞\n⎜─────────────────────────────, ───────────────────────⎟\n⎝   m₁⋅m₂ + m₁⋅m₃ + 4⋅m₂⋅m₃     m₁⋅m₂ + m₁⋅m₃ + 4⋅m₂⋅m₃⎠",
          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle \\left( \\frac{g m_{1} m_{2} + g m_{1} m_{3} - 4 g m_{2} m_{3}}{m_{1} m_{2} + m_{1} m_{3} + 4 m_{2} m_{3}}, \\  \\frac{2 g m_{1} m_{2} - 2 g m_{1} m_{3}}{m_{1} m_{2} + m_{1} m_{3} + 4 m_{2} m_{3}}\\right)$"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
        "image/png",
        "text/latex",
        "text/plain"
      ],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "30982fa9-85a7-4493-91b3-641eb60b7dbb",
      "cellIndex": 18,
      "originalCellId": "30982fa9-85a7-4493-91b3-641eb60b7dbb",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Function `args` selects elements from the set.\nIn this case, it shows the tuple that has both solutions.\nSymPy shows this structure between parenthesis.",
      "sourceSha256": "74088b3e3b61022744444d8dab7e86a64cdd4f197be91df6637d94a32c5be353",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": []
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "e28d63d4-5317-4d8b-b9af-97dd7d8cabb0",
      "cellIndex": 19,
      "originalCellId": "e28d63d4-5317-4d8b-b9af-97dd7d8cabb0",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "ypp_linsolve = sm.linsolve(systemEquations, variablesSolution).args[0]\nypp_linsolve",
      "sourceSha256": "6c9f17823dd91e796a08bd2cf903ee20e9e5a2e82d7353ffc56d6fc7090fa698",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "⎛g⋅m₁⋅m₂ + g⋅m₁⋅m₃ - 4⋅g⋅m₂⋅m₃   2⋅g⋅m₁⋅m₂ - 2⋅g⋅m₁⋅m₃ ⎞\n⎜─────────────────────────────, ───────────────────────⎟\n⎝   m₁⋅m₂ + m₁⋅m₃ + 4⋅m₂⋅m₃     m₁⋅m₂ + m₁⋅m₃ + 4⋅m₂⋅m₃⎠",
          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle \\left( \\frac{g m_{1} m_{2} + g m_{1} m_{3} - 4 g m_{2} m_{3}}{m_{1} m_{2} + m_{1} m_{3} + 4 m_{2} m_{3}}, \\  \\frac{2 g m_{1} m_{2} - 2 g m_{1} m_{3}}{m_{1} m_{2} + m_{1} m_{3} + 4 m_{2} m_{3}}\\right)$"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
        "image/png",
        "text/latex",
        "text/plain"
      ],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "sm.linsolve"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "50b7b94b-e3e0-487d-8793-8942004d3bad",
      "cellIndex": 20,
      "originalCellId": "50b7b94b-e3e0-487d-8793-8942004d3bad",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "We saved the solutions in `ypp_linsolve`, which lets us build equations for the solutions by cycling through the ordering number in the list of variables.",
      "sourceSha256": "e9af183eb169e787d22a4e4bdac1188516a9a681e7c6b8840e26454b51ed6456",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": []
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "bf4fcd2e-019c-4177-8adc-90e9b75d9b61",
      "cellIndex": 21,
      "originalCellId": "bf4fcd2e-019c-4177-8adc-90e9b75d9b61",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "sm.Eq(variablesSolution[0], ypp_linsolve[0]) # Selects the first element.",
      "sourceSha256": "95e127b0eb44ec615dff9b951f44ab6e2065133dd3bf82136da5e4d198ae1fcf",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "     g⋅m₁⋅m₂ + g⋅m₁⋅m₃ - 4⋅g⋅m₂⋅m₃\ny₁̈ = ─────────────────────────────\n        m₁⋅m₂ + m₁⋅m₃ + 4⋅m₂⋅m₃   ",
          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle \\ddot{y}_{1} = \\frac{g m_{1} m_{2} + g m_{1} m_{3} - 4 g m_{2} m_{3}}{m_{1} m_{2} + m_{1} m_{3} + 4 m_{2} m_{3}}$"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
        "image/png",
        "text/latex",
        "text/plain"
      ],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "pythonAst": {
        "imports": [],
        "calls": [
          "sm.Eq"
        ],
        "literalAssignments": {},
        "parseError": null
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "e2d2f11e-cfd5-4863-abd0-8c75e933d821",
      "cellIndex": 22,
      "originalCellId": "e2d2f11e-cfd5-4863-abd0-8c75e933d821",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "sm.Eq(variablesSolution[1], ypp_linsolve[1]) # Selects the second element.",
      "sourceSha256": "fcfcd3804874db18046ca94fc9ac0607b3a472b35b93e834c472ae2b856df177",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "execute_result",
          "text/plain": "      2⋅g⋅m₁⋅m₂ - 2⋅g⋅m₁⋅m₃ \ny₂̈ = ───────────────────────\n     m₁⋅m₂ + m₁⋅m₃ + 4⋅m₂⋅m₃",
          "text/latex": "$\\displaystyle \\ddot{y}_{2} = \\frac{2 g m_{1} m_{2} - 2 g m_{1} m_{3}}{m_{1} m_{2} + m_{1} m_{3} + 4 m_{2} m_{3}}$"
        }
      ],
      "outputMimeTypes": [
